  "coverage": [
    "Shared alignment_references validates semantic payloads and exposes stored point or finite-line direction references",
    "Forty historical segment-midpoint fixtures compare exact Float64 point/direction bytes through ApplicationApi jobs",
    "Precise point copies, raw directions, signed zero, positive/zero extent and bounded pagination preserve source state",
    "Malformed payloads, missing keys, sampled metadata, negative extent, nonfinite derived midpoint and CAD triangle lookup are rejected",
    "Locked semantic sources constrain supported moving scans through Preview and Apply; source objects remain unchanged",
    "Stale revisions fail; changed semantic geometry is reread; repeated request IDs apply once",
    "Server-rendered GUI selector options include semantic sources while moving target checkboxes exclude them",
    "Properties alignment discovery includes semantic entities and precise payload bits invalidate its component identity"
  ],
